{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53427","headline":"晓发桐庐 · 权德舆","name":"晓发桐庐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客路去漫漫，桐溪上水滩。\n扣船乘晓月，欹枕听回滩。\n烟重江枫湿，沙平宿鹭寒。\n闲吟试一望，疑在画屏看。\n（均见《四部丛刊》本《权载之文集》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}